  "resolution_rules":[
    "each physical header normalizes once and may resolve to at most one registry field",
    "two physical columns resolving to the same semantic field are a duplicate-semantic-header conflict and block the workbook before row mutation",
    "missing required identity header rejects the workbook",
    "missing optional-active or deferred headers create coverage findings and never clear prior accepted domain truth",
    "unregistered headers are discarded from domain staging after security/resource scanning and do not enter logical identity/fingerprint except through the registry-version identifier",
    "column order is irrelevant; logical serialization orders by canonical field key"
  ],
